        "description": "A24 is an American independent entertainment company that has redefined the landscape of modern cinema since its founding in 2012. Known for its distinctively curated portfolio of film and television, the brand bridges the gap between high-concept artistic expression and popular cultural appeal. Its projects frequently gain a cult following due to their psychological complexity, bold visual styles, and commitment to auteur voices. Beyond filmmaking, the company has expanded its influence through direct-to-consumer goods, memberships, and content platforms, solidifying its position as a central force in contemporary aesthetic and cultural discourse.",
