        "short_description": "A24 is an American independent entertainment company specializing in film and television production and distribution, known for unique and acclaimed movies.",
        "short_descriptions": [
          {
            "language": "fr",
            "value": "Une société de production et de distribution indépendante pionnière, réputée pour ses films audacieux, visionnaires et artistiquement avant-gardistes dans tous les genres."
          },
          {
            "language": "de",
            "value": "Ein wegweisendes unabhängiges Unterhaltungsunternehmen, das für die Produktion und den Vertrieb mutiger, visionärer und künstlerisch anspruchsvoller Filme über verschiedene Genres hinweg bekannt ist."
          },
          {
            "language": "es",
            "value": "Una productora y distribuidora independiente pionera, reconocida por sus películas audaces, visionarias y artísticamente vanguardistas en una gran variedad de géneros."
          },
          {
            "language": "en",
            "value": "A pioneering independent entertainment company renowned for producing and distributing bold, visionary, and artistically daring films across diverse genres."
          }
        ],
